## Ground rules

- Examples follow the standards in `.claude/guides/PERVAXIS_STANDARDS.md`.
- The package behind each example is the source of truth. If an example and the package disagree, trust the package and tell the platform team.
- Keep domain code in `Domains/`. Do not edit `Platform/Hosting/ForgeHost.cs` to wire a feature. Raise a platform ticket instead.


Ownership: Platform contains print-owned runtime code; Domains contains business modules. Data/Migrations is application-owned upgrade history and snapshot state, excluded from Platform replacement. See [the ownership and upgrade policy](Ownership.md).
